          <Text><cp IX="0"/><pp IX="0"/>RUN / FAULT / STOPPING / ACTIVATE = Fct.State_Run / State_Fault / State_Stopping /
State_Activate.
IHM.OK = Ech_Stand_Analyse.Stands.Popup_Temp_Analyse_IHM_RCP.Reponse.%X0.
SPV.BP0 / BP1 / BP2 = bits %X0 / %X1 / %X2 de Popup_Temp_Analyse_SPV_RCP.Reponse.
H2_TRAILER / H2_DEBUT / H2_MILIEU / H2_FIN = demandes Ech_Stand_Analyse.Stands.
SYNCHRO_OK / Flex_Trailer / H2.60PITx01 = champs du même objet Stands. RES.* =
Ech_Stand_Analyse.Analyseur.Resultat.*.</Text>
        </Shape>
